<section class="gg-hero">
  <div class="gg-container gg-hero-grid">
    <div class="gg-hero-content">
      <span class="gg-badge">Goal Grower Beta</span>

      <h1>Grow goals that feel alive.</h1>

      <p>
        Goal Grower turns habits and big goals into living plants.
        Show up, water your progress, and watch your personal garden take shape.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
        <a href="/pages/about" class="gg-btn-outline">See How It Works</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-hero-visual">
      <div class="gg-orbit-card">
        <div class="gg-phone-shell">
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            <div class="gg-app-top"></div>
            <div class="gg-garden-scene">
              <span class="gg-css-plant plant-one"></span>
              <span class="gg-css-plant plant-two"></span>
              <span class="gg-css-plant plant-three"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="gg-progress-line"></div>
            <div class="gg-progress-line short"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-floating-note note-one">
          <strong>Watered today</strong>
          <span>Consistency +1</span>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-floating-note note-two">
          <strong>Shared garden</strong>
          <span>Growing with friends</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-stack-wrapper">
  <article class="gg-stack-card gg-card-dark">
    <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
      <div>
        <span class="gg-mini-label">The problem</span>
        <h2>Most trackers feel like chores.</h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p>
          Checklists are easy to ignore. Streaks can feel stressful.
          Goal Grower gives your progress a visual life, so returning to your goals feels more personal.
        </p>

        <div class="gg-insight-list">
          <div>Cold task lists become living progress.</div>
          <div>Small actions become visible growth.</div>
          <div>Accountability becomes shared momentum.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="gg-stack-card gg-card-sage">
    <div class="gg-container">
      <span class="gg-mini-label">How it works</span>
      <h2>Plant. Water. Grow. Return.</h2>

      <div class="growth-stages">
        <div class="growth-stage">
          <span class="plant-mark seed"></span>
          <strong>Plant</strong>
          <p>Choose a goal and give it a place in your garden.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="growth-stage">
          <span class="plant-mark sprout"></span>
          <strong>Water</strong>
          <p>Complete actions that keep your plant alive.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="growth-stage">
          <span class="plant-mark plant"></span>
          <strong>Grow</strong>
          <p>Watch progress become visible over time.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="growth-stage">
          <span class="plant-mark bloom"></span>
          <strong>Bloom</strong>
          <p>Reach milestones and see what you have built.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="gg-stack-card gg-card-blue">
    <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
      <div>
        <span class="gg-mini-label">Your garden</span>
        <h2>Every goal has its own place.</h2>
        <p>
          Habits, big projects, spiritual goals, school goals, health goals, and business ideas can all live in one visual garden.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-dashboard-preview">
        <div class="gg-preview-card large"></div>
        <div class="gg-preview-card"></div>
        <div class="gg-preview-card"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="gg-stack-card gg-card-gold">
    <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
      <div>
        <span class="gg-mini-label">Shared gardens</span>
        <h2>Grow with people who care.</h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p>
          Invite friends, family, or accountability partners into shared gardens.
          Progress becomes something you can build together.
        </p>

        <div class="gg-shared-garden">
          <span class="gg-avatar"></span>
          <span class="gg-avatar"></span>
          <span class="gg-avatar"></span>
          <div class="gg-shared-line"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>

<section class="gg-page-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <span class="gg-mini-label">Built differently</span>
    <h2>A goal tracker with a pulse.</h2>

    <div class="gg-feature-grid">
      <div class="gg-feature-card">
        <span class="gg-feature-icon"></span>
        <h3>Human motivation</h3>
        <p>Designed around emotion, care, and returning after imperfect days.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-feature-card">
        <span class="gg-feature-icon alt"></span>
        <h3>Visual progress</h3>
        <p>Progress feels less abstract when your goals physically grow.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-feature-card">
        <span class="gg-feature-icon third"></span>
        <h3>Gentle accountability</h3>
        <p>Shared gardens help progress feel supported instead of lonely.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-final-cta">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <span class="gg-mini-label">Start small</span>
    <h2>What could your garden look like in a year?</h2>
    <p>Support the app while it grows from beta into something real.</p>
    <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Goal Grower Home",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Goal Grower Home" }]
}
{% endschema %}